1
00:00:08,490 --> 00:00:11,220
♪Amid the sea of faces♪

2
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:14,100
♪Our eyes meet by chance♪

3
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:17,460
♪Through the restless years♪

4
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:20,940
♪Time suddenly slows♪

5
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:24,380
♪No vows need be made♪

6
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:26,740
♪Though seas and mountains lie ahead♪

7
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:29,820
♪One glance says it all♪

8
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:33,260
♪Beyond a thousand words♪

9
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:37,660
♪With you by my side♪

10
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:40,780
♪I dare brave a thousand trials♪

11
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:44,060
♪Though mist may veil the road ahead♪

12
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:47,460
♪Hand in hand, no counting years♪

13
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:50,700
♪With you by my side♪

14
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:54,260
♪No need to speak my heart at length♪

15
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:57,580
♪As rivers and mountains change♪

16
00:00:57,580 --> 00:00:59,740
♪May we remain together♪

17
00:00:59,740 --> 00:01:03,900
♪From dawn to dusk♪

18
00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:06,980
=Daughter of a Concubine=

19
00:01:07,020 --> 00:01:09,940
=Episode 5=

20
00:01:18,820 --> 00:01:21,100
(In Memoriam)

21
00:01:22,140 --> 00:01:22,940
(In Memoriam)

22
00:01:28,160 --> 00:01:29,800
Yunyi...

23
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:33,440
Nanny Zhao!

24
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:35,440
Nanny Zhao, is that you?

25
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:38,360
Who locked you in here?

26
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:40,200
What did they do to you?

27
00:01:40,880 --> 00:01:42,320
Yunyi...

28
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:44,760
Run! Now!

29
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:45,920
They...

30
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:48,080
They're coming for you!

31
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:50,200
Run!

32
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,360
Xia Yunyi.

33
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:54,640
You think marrying into the Cheng family
makes you untouchable?

34
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:58,000
This coffin is for you.

35
00:01:58,120 --> 00:02:00,640
Just like the one
we prepared for your mother.

36
00:02:01,720 --> 00:02:04,640
I don't want you to be lonely
on your journey,

37
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:05,720
so,

38
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:08,120
I'm sending Nanny Zhao along with you.

39
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:09,880
Run!

40
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:11,840
Qin Jun!

41
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:12,480
Yes!

42
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:14,680
Turn Wang and Xia Yunshu over

43
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,720
to the authorities!

44
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:16,280
Understood!

45
00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:17,280
Stop!

46
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:17,940
(Wanqing Courtyard)

47
00:02:19,700 --> 00:02:24,380
(Xia Zhengchun, head of the Xia family,
Director of the Ministry of War)

48
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:25,880
My Lord!

49
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:30,120
My Lord!

50
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:31,240
You're back!

51
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:31,920
Father!

52
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:35,320
Xia Yunyi,

53
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:37,120
(Wanqing Courtyard)
what is the meaning of this?

54
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:39,600
How dare you bring outsiders
to cause trouble here!

55
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:41,640
Do you have no respect for me?

56
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:43,040
Father,

57
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,760
my mother is dead.

58
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,480
Nanny Zhao has been beaten
half to death.

59
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,840
And you blame me?

60
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:51,760
I've heard what happened.

61
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:53,920
Your mother took her own life.

62
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,320
No one else is to blame.

63
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:58,520
You're married now.

64
00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:00,720
You've not only offended
the Cheng family,

65
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:02,840
you can't even win
Young General's favor.

66
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:04,400
And now you dare come back here?

67
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:05,840
Besides,

68
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:08,840
Nanny Zhao's a servant of this house.

69
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:10,760
How we deal with her is our business!

70
00:03:11,160 --> 00:03:12,640
You have no say in it.

71
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:14,840
I have no say?

72
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:19,640
My mother was your rightful wife.

73
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:21,920
But as soon as Wang joined this family,

74
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,160
you made her your principal wife

75
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:24,920
and handed her control of the household.

76
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:27,360
For more than ten years,

77
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:29,880
she's treated us like animals.

78
00:03:29,880 --> 00:03:31,560
Have you ever lifted a finger
to help us?

79
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:34,280
Now my mother passed away,

80
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:36,600
and you won't even let her have justice.

81
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:39,120
Nanny Zhao raised me from childhood.

82
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,400
Look what they've done to her.

83
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,880
And you say
I have no right to intervene?

84
00:03:41,880 --> 00:03:42,520
Enough!

85
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:45,960
The matter of Liu's death is settled.

86
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:48,200
(Wanqing Courtyard)
Return to the Cheng Residence at once.

87
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:49,360
(Wanqing Courtyard)
Stop stirring up trouble.

88
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:51,800
I won't have you disgracing this family!

89
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:55,720
Of course.

90
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:02,080
All you care about
is the Xia family's reputation.

91
00:04:04,440 --> 00:04:05,560
But what about my mother?

92
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:09,120
She's dead.

93
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:12,880
What does that do
to the Xia family's reputation?

94
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:17,240
Do you know that?

95
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:20,880
When my mother lay dying,

96
00:04:21,400 --> 00:04:22,880
she held my hand

97
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,480
and said...

98
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:27,160
(Your father)

99
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:31,200
(won't come to see me.)

100
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:36,160
When Wang seized power and took lives,

101
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:38,600
when she stripped my mother
of her rightful place,

102
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:39,880
you were nowhere to be found.

103
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:42,520
When my mother died,
you were nowhere to be found again.

104
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:44,760
Now I've come back for justice,

105
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:46,280
and who are you to stop me?

106
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:52,160
How dare you speak
to your father like that?

107
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:54,440
You've committed the gravest impiety!

108
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:02,920
Some father you are!

109
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:06,040
Some matriarch she is!

110
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:07,800
Some family this is!

111
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:09,000
(In Memoriam)

112
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:10,960
Every last one of you

113
00:05:11,320 --> 00:05:12,600
is heartless,

114
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:13,520
unjust,

115
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:15,000
and cruel!

116
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:17,440
Yet you expect me

117
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:19,600
to be respectful, obedient, and dutiful?

118
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:22,840
You've taken everything for yourselves,

119
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:25,440
and left my mother and me to suffer.

120
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:26,800
Not a chance!

121
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,360
You...

122
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,600
From this day forward,

123
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:31,960
I am no longer part of the Xia family.

124
00:05:33,400 --> 00:05:36,800
I hereby sever all ties
with the Xia family.

125
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:37,600
How dare you!

126
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:38,400
Qin Jun!

127
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:39,000
Got it!

128
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:45,840
My Lady.

129
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:47,920
What are you doing?

130
00:05:49,900 --> 00:05:50,500
(In Memoriam)

131
00:05:50,780 --> 00:05:52,380
(Memorial tablet of Liu Rumei)

132
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,400
You...

133
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:56,760
If you won't give my mother justice,

134
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:59,000
I'll get it myself!

135
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:00,520
Stop right there!

136
00:06:03,460 --> 00:06:04,700
(Memorial tablet of Liu Rumei)

137
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,160
Let me go!

138
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:22,720
Don't move!

139
00:06:23,660 --> 00:06:24,580
(Memorial tablet of Liu Rumei)

140
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:28,720
My Lady!

141
00:06:29,020 --> 00:06:33,520
(Qinghe Pavilion)

142
00:06:33,520 --> 00:06:34,360
Qin Jun.

143
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:36,280
You're a guard of the Cheng family,

144
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:38,120
not Xia Yunyi's hired muscle.

145
00:06:38,300 --> 00:06:40,140
(Qinghe Pavilion)

146
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:41,720
Yunyi.

147
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,200
(Qinghe Pavilion)
Quite a spectacle,

148
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:46,840
bringing my brother's personal guards
to stir up trouble at your own home.

149
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:49,600
Aren't you afraid
of becoming a laughingstock?

150
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:50,520
Cheng Xiao.

151
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:51,400
What are you doing here?

152
00:06:51,400 --> 00:06:53,240
(Qinghe Pavilion)
I'm here to handle things for Mingzhi.

153
00:06:53,520 --> 00:06:54,880
He's tied up with military affairs.

154
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:58,000
Someone has to take care
of family matters.

155
00:06:58,160 --> 00:07:00,640
Put Xia Yunyi in that coffin!

156
00:07:00,640 --> 00:07:01,720
Wait!

157
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,880
Mother.

158
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:04,640
Killing her outright

159
00:07:04,640 --> 00:07:05,720
would be too easy for her.

160
00:07:05,960 --> 00:07:06,960
What do you want?

161
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:09,480
I want her to kneel and beg my pardon

162
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:12,520
before crawling into that coffin
of her own will.

163
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,200
Xia Yunyi.

164
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:24,680
Kneel and apologize.

165
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:26,280
Then I'll let Nanny Zhao go.

166
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:29,840
Right now!

167
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:44,000
My Lady!

168
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:48,920
(In Memoriam)
Get up.

169
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:49,640
(In Memoriam)
Young General!

170
00:07:56,440 --> 00:07:57,000
Oh...

171
00:08:14,740 --> 00:08:17,500
(Memorial tablet of Liu Rumei)

172
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:30,200
Cheng Xiao.

173
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:32,400
What should I do with you?

174
00:08:37,880 --> 00:08:38,680
Mingzhi...

175
00:08:41,740 --> 00:08:44,580
(Memorial tablet of Liu Rumei)

176
00:08:46,220 --> 00:08:47,880
(In Memoriam;
Memorial tablet of Liu Rumei)

177
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:48,680
Lord Xia.

178
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:52,120
My wife came home to pay you a visit,

179
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:54,000
and this is how you treat her?

180
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,920
Young General, you've got it all wrong.

181
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,240
It's a misunderstanding.

182
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:01,000
A complete misunderstanding.

183
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:03,240
Yunyi is still a daughter
of the Xia family.

184
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,840
How could we mistreat her?

185
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:06,520
The coffin was a misunderstanding too?

186
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,280
(Wanqing Courtyard)
Lord Xia,

187
00:09:11,280 --> 00:09:13,280
(Wanqing Courtyard)
I didn't come here to stir up trouble,

188
00:09:13,560 --> 00:09:14,920
but to take my wife home.

189
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:16,680
But first,

190
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:19,280
there are a few matters
we need to settle.

191
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:24,480
Well...

192
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:26,960
(In Memoriam)
That is an old servant of our family.

193
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:32,600
My wife wants to take her with us.

194
00:09:32,760 --> 00:09:34,000
Do you agree?

195
00:09:34,160 --> 00:09:34,960
Yes.

196
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:36,880
Of course.

197
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,640
Whatever you say.

198
00:09:39,280 --> 00:09:40,640
(Memorial tablet of Liu Rumei)
Take Nanny Zhao back to my residence.

199
00:09:40,640 --> 00:09:41,480
(Memorial tablet of Liu Rumei)
Make sure she's well cared for.

200
00:09:41,680 --> 00:09:42,440
Yes, General.

201
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:46,720
Lord Xia.

202
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:51,080
Wang held Nanny Zhao hostage
to threaten my wife.

203
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:52,440
How do you intend to punish her?

204
00:09:52,520 --> 00:09:53,320
Well...

205
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:58,160
My Lord.

206
00:09:58,800 --> 00:10:01,240
I punished a lowly servant of our family

207
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:03,520
and disciplined a concubine
of our family.

208
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:05,600
That's an internal Xia family matter.

209
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:07,200
Outsiders have no right to interfere.

210
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:09,160
Lord Xia.

211
00:10:09,160 --> 00:10:11,000
If you don't give me
a proper answer today,

212
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:13,520
word of this will reach His Majesty
in no time.

213
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:17,520
Let's see how well your family holds up
under scrutiny.

214
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:19,480
Wang is confined

215
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:20,560
for three months.

216
00:10:21,160 --> 00:10:22,280
Without my permission,

217
00:10:22,800 --> 00:10:23,680
she's not to leave.

218
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:24,360
Xia Zhengchun!

219
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,400
One more word,

220
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:27,120
and I'll make it six months!

221
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:37,720
Wait!

222
00:10:38,560 --> 00:10:39,560
Who said you could leave?

223
00:10:41,640 --> 00:10:42,480
Lord Xia.

224
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:45,280
Don't you think that's far too lenient?

225
00:10:49,400 --> 00:10:50,800
What do you want?

226
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:52,720
I'm the matriarch of the Xia family.

227
00:10:53,680 --> 00:10:55,360
Whatever I order her to do,

228
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:57,080
she has no choice but to obey.

229
00:11:08,020 --> 00:11:12,020
(A Legacy of Virtue)

230
00:11:20,300 --> 00:11:24,660
(Memorial tablet of Liu Rumei)

231
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:31,400
(Memorial tablet of Liu Rumei)
From this day on,

232
00:11:31,760 --> 00:11:33,200
incense must burn

233
00:11:33,520 --> 00:11:35,880
for my mother every day!

234
00:11:37,560 --> 00:11:38,560
Wang.

235
00:11:39,480 --> 00:11:41,240
Did you kill my mother?

236
00:11:45,560 --> 00:11:46,800
Xia Yunyi.

237
00:11:47,040 --> 00:11:48,640
If I'd wanted her dead,

238
00:11:49,280 --> 00:11:51,120
she wouldn't have lasted a year.

239
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:54,160
I just wanted to watch her suffer.

240
00:11:55,080 --> 00:11:56,240
Besides,

241
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:57,640
if she were dead,

242
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,800
how could I have tormented you?

243
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:13,480
You said earlier

244
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:18,000
this coffin was meant for me.

245
00:12:21,400 --> 00:12:24,800
Did you prepare one
for yourself as well?

246
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:27,640
No.

247
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:31,920
Then get in and try it!

248
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:33,960
Qin Jun.

249
00:12:35,520 --> 00:12:36,320
Wait...

250
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:38,280
- Young General...
- Lord Xia.

251
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:43,960
Do it!

252
00:12:45,520 --> 00:12:46,320
My Lord...

253
00:12:48,920 --> 00:12:50,080
Young General,

254
00:12:50,080 --> 00:12:52,440
I'm afraid that's going too far.

255
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:53,400
Lord Xia!

256
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:05,160
Do it!

257
00:13:05,160 --> 00:13:06,240
- Stop...
- Stay still!

258
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:11,040
Do it!

259
00:13:11,040 --> 00:13:11,720
Mother!

260
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:17,040
Get in.

261
00:13:17,680 --> 00:13:18,480
Get in!

262
00:13:27,800 --> 00:13:28,800
Wang.

263
00:13:29,840 --> 00:13:31,480
How do you like your coffin?

264
00:13:32,560 --> 00:13:33,840
Xia Yunyi.

265
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:36,760
You'll pay for this!

266
00:13:36,760 --> 00:13:38,160
When have you ever spared me?

267
00:13:38,160 --> 00:13:38,960
Lie still!

268
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:41,280
Remember this.

269
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:45,280
This is for my mother.

270
00:13:45,280 --> 00:13:47,620
(In Memoriam)

271
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:48,680
Close the lid.

272
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:50,100
(A Legacy of Virtue)

273
00:13:51,520 --> 00:13:53,280
Yunyi, please spare my mother!

274
00:13:53,280 --> 00:13:55,080
I was wrong!

275
00:13:56,560 --> 00:13:57,360
Yunyi.

276
00:13:58,440 --> 00:14:01,400
She's still your aunt!

277
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:02,640
Lord Xia.

278
00:14:02,840 --> 00:14:04,160
Do you remember

279
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:05,920
that I was your daughter once, too?

280
00:14:09,600 --> 00:14:10,480
Mother!

281
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:18,480
You...

282
00:14:22,040 --> 00:14:22,920
Lord Xia.

283
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:25,000
From this day forward,

284
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:26,320
I renounce the Xia name.

285
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:28,160
My surname is Liu.

286
00:14:34,940 --> 00:14:41,140
(A Legacy of Virtue)

287
00:14:57,740 --> 00:15:03,180
♪Let the past be buried in the wind♪

288
00:15:04,510 --> 00:15:09,260
♪Perhaps the waning moon knows my pain♪

289
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:13,660
♪It sees the old tenderness
all come to nothing♪

290
00:15:13,660 --> 00:15:16,940
♪How many regrets haunt this world♪

291
00:15:16,940 --> 00:15:23,060
♪By the window, whose dreams flicker
by the dying candle♪

292
00:15:25,190 --> 00:15:29,660
♪Things remain, you're gone,
and I'm still dazed♪

293
00:15:30,660 --> 00:15:33,020
♪The sandstorm in my eyes♪

294
00:15:33,020 --> 00:15:36,380
♪Turns to a blade's edge♪
(Cheng Residence)

295
00:15:37,680 --> 00:15:39,380
♪Cutting through old years♪

296
00:15:39,380 --> 00:15:41,100
♪We can never embrace again♪

297
00:15:41,100 --> 00:15:46,180
♪If rain has tears,
wash away the dust of fate♪

298
00:15:46,270 --> 00:15:48,180
♪By lamplight, I turn the page♪

299
00:15:48,180 --> 00:15:51,100
♪The ink dries, and there you are♪

300
00:15:51,100 --> 00:15:52,940
♪Gone to ash in a flash♪

301
00:15:52,940 --> 00:15:54,660
♪Like a blade through my heart♪

302
00:15:54,660 --> 00:15:58,180
♪Too late to pull away♪

303
00:15:58,180 --> 00:16:00,580
♪The song ends, and all have gone♪

304
00:16:00,580 --> 00:16:04,740
♪Now we must part♪

305
00:16:04,740 --> 00:16:08,340
♪Flowers burn the ground,
yet vows are held so lightly♪

306
00:16:08,340 --> 00:16:11,740
♪The song ends.
Where shall I seek you in dreams♪

307
00:16:11,980 --> 00:16:14,060
♪By the window, a dying candle♪

308
00:16:14,060 --> 00:16:18,980
♪Whose shadow do I yearn for♪
